{"id":"9226722c3f91f771","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-disquotational-schema.md","title":"去引号公理","display":"df-disquotational-schema — 去引号公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-disquotational-schema","aliases":["91-df-disquotational-schema"],"display":"df-disquotational-schema — 去引号公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-disquotational-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-disquotational-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-disquotational-schema — 去引号公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-disquotational-schema-—-去引号公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}$\">df-disquotational-schema — 去引号公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的基础语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}\\)</span> (句子编码的数字名)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disquotational\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disquotational\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}\\)</span> : 去引号公理（disquotational axiom）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span> : 断言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是真的（不带等价）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>去引号公理的含义：\n去引号模式把每个基础语言句子与关于其编码的真理断言联系起来；它不直接断言每个基础语言句子都真。</p>\n<p>去引号公理 vs T-schema：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>公理内容</th>\n<th>推理方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>T-schema</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td>双向等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去引号模式</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td>双向等价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>这里的“去引号模式”就是基础语言上的 T-schema 实例族，因而两个方向\n都由双条件本身给出；单独采用某一方向时应另名为 T-in 或 T-out 原则。</p>\n<p>去引号公理在理论中的应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>UTB使用去引号公理的形式</li>\n<li>去引号公理足够证明基础语言定理</li>\n<li>去引号公理是保守扩张的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-disquotational-schema-—-去引号公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}$","text":"df-disquotational-schema — 去引号公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disquotational\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{dis}}","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1754,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-disquotational-schema]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-disquotational-schema]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-K